# Go standard library (crypto/x509, net/http, …) in gosu of postgres:18-alpine and mongo:8.0 and in
# the bundled data-source plugins of grafana/grafana:13.2.6 (stdlib 1.26.7). gosu opens no network
# connection; the dashboard tool listens only on 127.0.0.1 until TLS exists (R14) and the stack
# configures only its Prometheus, Loki, and Tempo sources. Upstream must rebuild the images.
CVE-2026-78667 exp:2027-01-11
CVE-2026-78669 exp:2027-01-11
CVE-2026-97031 exp:2027-01-11
CVE-2026-111943 exp:2027-01-11

# js-yaml in the Node.js tools bundled with mongo:8.0 (mongosh); the stack does not run mongosh.
# Upstream must update it.
CVE-2026-59869 exp:2027-01-11
CVE-2026-84375 exp:2027-01-11
GHSA-5p4m-2wfm-xmqj exp:2027-01-11

# Jackson, Jetty, and Guava in the Nouveau search server bundled with couchdb:3.5 (opt/couchdb/nouveau);
# 3.5.3 (rebuilt 2026-11-24) still ships them. CouchDB does not start Nouveau (off by default, the
# stack neither enables nor runs it), so the Java code is never executed. Upstream must update them.
